   If you want the real answer to this sans all those disqualifiers...

 That answer is...


















  Remember to "Hard Save" (save and quit) any 'good' character you are
happy with, and while quit, copy said save file to an ARCHIVAL directory.

  Note that we still have not committed the taboo of resurrecting a
character that we died with in the game.

  Perform this 'staggered save' often (every session) as you play your
